              <div class="form-text">Uses your profile photo from My Website. Turn off to show your name and contact details here without a photo — your photo still appears elsewhere (Agent Info card, newsletter, header) unless removed from your profile.</div>
              <div class="form-text"><i class="fas fa-clock me-1"></i>Your opening hours show beside this form when you have set them. Enter them, or switch them off here, under <a href="/portal/Website#hours">My Website &gt; Business hours</a>.</div>
            </div>
